{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/2uwblo","slide":1,"title":"Physics to arrays and plots","textShapes":5}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5kz2tc3e","slide":1,"text":"Physics to arrays and plots","textPreview":"Physics to arrays and plots","textChars":27,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ih8jix43","slide":1,"text":"A vertical launch becomes a sequence of checked calculations","textPreview":"A vertical launch becomes a sequence of checked calculations","textChars":60,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jihkr2l8","slide":1,"text":"Question","textPreview":"Question","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,290,500,60]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wv61g7mx","slide":1,"text":"How can MATLAB calculate the ball’s height at many times and reveal the motion in one labelled plot?","textPreview":"How can MATLAB calculate the ball’s height at many times and reveal the motion in one labelled plot?","textChars":100,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,370,690,180]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/hwz2pc3i","slide":1,"bbox":[980,270,650,430]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/utojex4r","slide":1,"text":"launch → rise → peak → return","textPreview":"launch → rise → peak → return","textChars":29,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1050,420,500,80]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/2uwblo","slide":1,"text":"[Sources]\n- PHY4605 Week materials and retained course assets\n[/Sources]"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/5qrbko","slide":2,"title":"1","textShapes":8}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a14fy107","slide":2,"text":"1","textPreview":"1","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1764,976,40,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4fy9gji","slide":2,"text":"Start with the physical prediction","textPreview":"Start with the physical prediction","textChars":34,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w3mx0bix","slide":2,"text":"Upward is positive; gravity is constant; air resistance is neglected","textPreview":"Upward is positive; gravity is constant; air resistance is neglected","textChars":68,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/j6xgbq1o","slide":2,"bbox":[130,280,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i5oz2l03","slide":2,"text":"1. At 0 s: y = 0 m","textPreview":"1. At 0 s: y = 0 m","textChars":18,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,299,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/58fydgju","slide":2,"bbox":[130,384,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k76h4vi9","slide":2,"text":"2. The ball rises and slows","textPreview":"2. The ball rises and slows","textChars":27,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,403,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zatgzm1k","slide":2,"bbox":[130,488,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y9kfqhkz","slide":2,"text":"3. The graph has one peak","textPreview":"3. The graph has one peak","textChars":25,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,507,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/4by5oje1","slide":2,"bbox":[130,592,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5c7mhofm","slide":2,"text":"4. It returns toward y = 0 m","textPreview":"4. It returns toward y = 0 m","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,611,522,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ipgnm9wv","slide":2,"text":"A graph is evidence only if it agrees with this physical story.","textPreview":"A graph is evidence only if it agrees with this physical story.","textChars":63,"textLines":1,"bbox":[900,440,700,90]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/5qrbko","slide":2,"text":"[Sources]\n- PHY4605 Week materials and retained course assets\n[/Sources]"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/rgbyge","slide":3,"title":"2","textShapes":7}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8ruxcjqx","slide":3,"text":"2","textPreview":"2","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1764,976,40,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7qlwjepc","slide":3,"text":"The model connects physics to calculation","textPreview":"The model connects physics to calculation","textChars":41,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mpcfat8r","slide":3,"text":"Each variable carries a value and a unit","textPreview":"Each variable carries a value and a unit","textChars":40,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/lo3eho76","slide":3,"bbox":[170,330,1020,120]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/knax8jql","slide":3,"text":"y(t) = y0 + v0*t - 0.5*g*t^2","textPreview":"y(t) = y0 + v0*t - 0.5*g*t^2","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[198,355,964,75]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zm1wfep0","slide":3,"bbox":[1350,300,360,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ylsf698f","slide":3,"text":"1. y0 = 0 m","textPreview":"1. y0 = 0 m","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1374,319,312,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/xkjed47a","slide":3,"bbox":[1350,404,360,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cjax4zqp","slide":3,"text":"2. v0 = 20 m s⁻¹","textPreview":"2. v0 = 20 m s⁻¹","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1374,423,312,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/yxo7ilwr","slide":3,"bbox":[1350,508,360,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zyxorqxc","slide":3,"text":"3. g = 9.81 m s⁻²","textPreview":"3. g = 9.81 m s⁻²","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1374,527,312,38]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rgbyge","slide":3,"text":"[Sources]\n- PHY4605 Week materials and retained course assets\n[/Sources]"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/qcg1t7","slide":4,"title":"3","textShapes":7}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/50zi1kfu","slide":4,"text":"3","textPreview":"3","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1764,976,40,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ix8zq5g3","slide":4,"text":"A time array stores many sample moments","textPreview":"A time array stores many sample moments","textChars":39,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jyh0zaxo","slide":4,"text":"Use one position for every time value","textPreview":"Use one position for every time value","textChars":37,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/s3ahwzy5","slide":4,"bbox":[130,290,600,100]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t4ji5kfq","slide":4,"text":"t_s = 0:0.5:4;","textPreview":"t_s = 0:0.5:4;","textChars":14,"textLines":1,"bbox":[158,315,544,55]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/618zupgf","slide":4,"text":"Index:   1      2      3      …      9","textPreview":"Index:   1      2      3      …      9","textChars":38,"textLines":1,"bbox":[130,500,1200,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r2h03ux0","slide":4,"text":"Time:    0    0.5    1.0     …    4.0 s","textPreview":"Time:    0    0.5    1.0     …    4.0 s","textChars":39,"textLines":1,"bbox":[130,560,1200,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gra10zyh","slide":4,"text":"MATLAB indexing starts at 1.","textPreview":"MATLAB indexing starts at 1.","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[130,720,900,60]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qcg1t7","slide":4,"text":"[Sources]\n- PHY4605 Week materials and retained course assets\n[/Sources]"}
