{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1k76d8bu","slide":10,"text":"The complete reasoning chain is reusable","textPreview":"The complete reasoning chain is reusable","textChars":40,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gjy543u9","slide":10,"text":"Model → units → array → calculation → plot → check → explanation","textPreview":"Model → units → array → calculation → plot → check → explanation","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3m9ofitk","slide":10,"text":"The code is not the goal. The goal is a result you can explain and validate.","textPreview":"The code is not the goal. The goal is a result you can explain and validate.","textChars":76,"textLines":1,"bbox":[180,350,1420,110]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bo1qbm","slide":10,"text":"[Sources]\n- PHY4605 Week materials and retained course assets\n[/Sources]"}
